<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.7">
<l>koṅkaic ciṟuvarai yeṉṉum potumpiṉil vīḻntu vaḻukki</l>
<l>yaṅkōr muḻaiyiṉil pukkiṭ ṭaḻuntik kiṭantuḻal vēṉai</l>
<l>vaṅkak kaṭalvaṇṇa ṉammāṉ valviṉai yāyiṉa māṟṟi</l>
<l>paṅkap paṭāvaṇṇam ceytāṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Having slipped and fallen into a pit</l>
<l rend="indent">called ‘breasts like little hills,’</l>
<l>I entered a cave there and sunk,</l>
<l rend="indent">staying and wandering about.</l>
<l>The Lord, the colour of the ship [laden] sea,</l>
<l rend="indent">having relieved [me of my] powerful karma,</l>
<l>made [for me] a path without disgrace.</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
